#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Page about the negative blending modes in Krita: Additive Subtractive, Arcus "
"Tangent, Difference, Equivalence, Exclusion, Negation."
msgstr ""
"Pagina over de negatieve mengmodi in Krita: Toegevoegde weggehaalde, "
"Arctangens, Verschil, Gelijkheid, Uitsluiting en Negatie."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:12
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:16
msgid "Negative"
msgstr "Negatief"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:18
msgid "These are all blending modes which seem to make the image go negative."
msgstr ""
"Dit zijn alle mengmodi die het laten lijken dat de afbeelding negatief wordt."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:20
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:24
msgid "Additive Subtractive"
msgstr "Toegevoegde weggehaalde"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:28
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Additive Subtractive\" in English."
msgstr ""
"Deze mengmodus wordt in het Engels \"Additive Subtractive\" en in het "
"Nederlands \"Toegevoegde weggehaalde\" genoemd."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:30
msgid "Subtracts the square root of the lower layer from the upper layer."
msgstr ""
"Trekt de tweede machtswortel van de onderliggende laag af van de "
"bovenliggende laag."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:35
msgid ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Additive_Subtractive_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Additive_Subtractive_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:35
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Additive Subtractive**."
msgstr "Links: **Normaal**. Rechts: **Toegevoegde weggehaalde**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:37
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:41
msgid "Arcus Tangent"
msgstr "Arctangens"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:45
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Arcus Tangent\" in English."
msgstr ""
"Deze mengmodus wordt in het Engels \"Arcus Tangent\" en in het Nederlands "
"\"Arctangens\" genoemd."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:47
msgid ""
"Divides the lower layer by the top. Then divides this by Pi. Then uses that "
"in an Arc tangent function, and multiplies it by two."
msgstr ""
"Deelt de onderliggende laag door de top. Deelt dit door Pi. Gebruikt dat "
"vervolgens in een Arc tangens functie, en vermenigvuldigt het met twee."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:53
msgid ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Arcus_Tangent_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Arcus_Tangent_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:53
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Arcus Tangent**."
msgstr "Links: **Normaal**. Rechts: **Arctangens**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:55
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:59
msgid "Difference"
msgstr "Verschil"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:63
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Difference\" in English."
msgstr ""
"Deze mengmodus wordt in het Engels \"Difference\" en in het Nederlands "
"\"Verschil\" genoemd."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:65
msgid ""
"Checks per pixel of which layer the pixel-value is highest/lowest, and then "
"subtracts the lower value from the higher-value."
msgstr ""
"Vergelijkt per pixel welke laag de pixel-gegevens het hoogste/laagste is, en "
"trekt vervolgens de lagere waarde af van de hogere waarde."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:71
msgid ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Difference_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Difference_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:71
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Difference**."
msgstr "Links: **Normaal**. Rechts: **Verschil**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:73
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:77
msgid "Equivalence"
msgstr "Gelijkheid"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:81
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Equivalence\" in English."
msgstr ""
"Deze mengmodus wordt in het Engels \"Equivalence\" en in het Nederlands "
"\"Gelijkheid\" genoemd."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:83
msgid ""
"Subtracts the underlying layer from the upper-layer. Then inverts that. "
"Seems to produce the same result as :ref:`bm_difference`."
msgstr ""
"Trekt de onderliggende laag af van de bovenliggende laag. En inverteert "
"vervolgens dat. Lijkt hetzelfde resultaat te geven als :ref:`bm_difference`."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:89
msgid ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Equivalence_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Equivalence_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:89
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Equivalence**."
msgstr "Links: **Normaal**. Rechts: **Gelijkheid**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:91
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:95
msgid "Exclusion"
msgstr "Uitsluiting"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:99
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Exclusion\" in English."
msgstr ""
"Deze mengmodus wordt in het Engels \"Exclusion\" en in het Nederlands "
"\"Uitsluiting\" genoemd."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:101
msgid ""
"This multiplies the two layers, adds the source, and then subtracts the "
"multiple of two layers twice."
msgstr ""
"Dit vermenigvuldigt de twee lagen met elkaar, telt de bron erbij op, en "
"trekt vervolgens de vermenigvuldiging er twee keer af."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:106
msgid ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Exclusion_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Exclusion_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:106
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Exclusion**."
msgstr "Links: **Normaal**. Rechts: **Uitsluiting**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:108
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:112
msgid "Negation"
msgstr "Negatie"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:116
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Negation\" in English."
msgstr ""
"Deze mengmodus wordt in het Engels \"Negation\" en in het Nederlands "
"\"Negatie\" genoemd."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:118
msgid ""
"The absolute of the 1.0f value subtracted by the base subtracted by the "
"blend layer. abs(1.0f - Base - Blend)"
msgstr ""
"De absolute waarde van de 1.0f waarde afgetrokken van de basis afgetrokken "
"van de menglaag. abs(1.0f - Basis - Menglaag)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:123
msgid ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Negation_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/blending_modes/negative/"
"Blending_modes_Negation_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/negative.rst:123
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Negation**."
msgstr "Links: **Normaal**. Rechts: **Negatie**."
